  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution towards operational costs of FABC offices</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FABC Central Secretariat has to raise annually US$150,000.00~US$175,000.00 for its overall expenses which include subsidizing the Operational Expenses of nine FABC Offices, four FABC Desks and the FABC Documentation Centre. FABC have struggled to cover these operational costs and in 2014/15 CAFOD agreed to provide the Central Secretariat with funding to cover the following two offices and one desk:
- Office of Human Development (OHD). This will contribute towards the Camillian Pastoral Centre programme on peace and tolerance in Bangkok in April 2015. The funds will also support the &apos;Joy of the Gospel&apos; programme within OHD.
- Office of Social Communication (OSC). This will contribute towards a series of broadcasts informing Radio Veritas Asia (RVA) listeners about the topic of climate change expected to begin on April 22 2015 (Earth Day).
- Climate Change Desk &#x2013; Central Secretariat 

CAFOD hopes to develop our engagement with FABC around their climate change programme and would like to direct future FABC funding to this programme. As such, contributions to the operational costs of FABC will be short term and the partner is aware of this.</narrative>
  </description>
